{"id":517,"title":"挑战2: 寻找峰值元素","summary":"在本课中，找到给定列表中的峰值元素，也就是大于或等于其两个邻居的元素。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4046600e-54cc-482c-b468-2d7d079c349b","text":"## 峰值元素\n\n列表中的峰值元素是大于或等于其邻居的元素。对于列表首尾的元素，我们只考虑它的单个邻居。\n\n> 注意: 列表不一定是排序列表！","text_html":"<h2>峰值元素</h2>\n<p>列表中的峰值元素是大于或等于其邻居的元素。对于列表首尾的元素，我们只考虑它的单个邻居。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>注意: 列表不一定是排序列表！</p>\n</blockquote>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"CanvasAnimation","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"76cf686c-66d7-4e83-afac-a3995ac51dab","width":600,"height":200,"canvas_objects":[{"caption":"一个列表中可能有多个峰值元素","width":600,"height":200,"canvas_json":"{\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"objects\":[{\"type\":\"group\",\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"originX\":\"left\",\"originY\":\"top\",\"left\":154.83,\"top\":50,\"width\":289.33,\"height\":50.67,\"fill\":\"\",\"stroke\":null,\"strokeWidth\":1,\"strokeDashArray\":null,\"strokeLineCap\":\"butt\",\"strokeDashOffset\":0,\"strokeLineJoin\":\"miter\",\"strokeMiterLimit\":10,\"scaleX\":1,\"scaleY\":1,\"angle\":0,\"flipX\":false,\"flipY\":false,\"opacity\":1,\"shadow\":null,\"visible\":true,\"clipTo\":null,\"backgroundColor\":\"\",\"fillRule\":\"nonzero\",\"paintFirst\":\"fill\",\"globalCompositeOperation\":\"source-over\",\"transformMatrix\":null,\"skewX\":0,\"skewY\":0,\"objects\":[{\"type\":\"polygon\",\"version\":\"3.6.6\",\"originX\":\"left\",\"originY\":\"top\",\"left\":-139.67,\"top\":-19.66,\"width\":35.2,\"height\":29,\"fill\":\"#e13a55\",\"stroke\":\"#000000\",\"strokeWidth\":0.5,\"strokeDashArray\":null,\"strokeLineCap\":\"butt\",\"strokeDashOffset\":0,\"strokeLineJoin\":\"miter\",\"strokeMiterLimit\":10,\"scaleX\":1.33,\"scaleY\":1.33,\"angle\":0,\"flipX\":false,\"flipY\":false,\"opacity\":1,\"shadow\":null,\"visible\":true,\"clipTo\":null,\"backgroundColor\":\"\",\"fillRule\":\"nonzero\",\"paintFirst\":\"fill\",\"globalCompositeOperation\":\"source-over\",\"transformMatrix\":null,\"skewX\":0,\"skewY\":0,